# The episode timings must reach the model through from_env — the path that can
# actually be broken (gotcha #9). Drop the propagation and a dogfood run's
# BANSHEE_EPISODE_UP_SECS=0 silently stays at 120.
file: rust/banshee-api/src/sampler.rs
test: the_resolved_cadence_is_propagated_to_the_pressure_model
---OLD---
        p.episode_up_secs = env_secs("BANSHEE_EPISODE_UP_SECS", p.episode_up_secs);
